## 🎯 Development Workflow

### **Best Practice: Use Both!**

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "zerodb-dev": {
      "command": "zerodb-memory-mcp",
      "env": {
        "ZERODB_API_URL": "http://localhost:8000",
        "ZERODB_PROJECT_ID": "dev-project"
      }
    },
    "zerodb-prod": {
      "command": "zerodb-memory-mcp",
      "env": {
        "ZERODB_API_URL": "https://api.ainative.studio",
        "ZERODB_PROJECT_ID": "prod-project"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Benefits:**
- 🧪 **Develop locally** - Fast iteration, no API costs
- ☁️ **Deploy to cloud** - Production data, global access
- 🔄 **Sync between them** - Best of both worlds

---

## 📊 Comparison: Local vs Cloud

| Feature | ZeroLocal | ZeroDB Cloud |
|---------|-----------|--------------|
| **Speed** | ⚡ Instant (localhost) | 🌐 Network latency |
| **Cost** | 💰 $0 | 💰 Pay per use |
| **Data** | 🔒 100% local | ☁️ Managed cloud |
| **Setup** | 🐳 Docker required | ✅ Instant signup |
| **Sync** | 🔄 Optional | ✅ Built-in |
| **Scale** | 💻 Your hardware | ♾️ Auto-scaling |
| **Offline** | ✅ Works offline | ❌ Needs internet |
| **MCP Support** | ✅ SAME API | ✅ SAME API |

