## 🔄 Sync Workflow

### **Develop Locally, Deploy to Cloud**

```bash
# 1. Develop with ZeroLocal
export ZERODB_API_URL="http://localhost:8000"
# Build your agent, test locally

# 2. When ready, sync to cloud
zerodb sync push

# 3. Switch to cloud
export ZERODB_API_URL="https://api.ainative.studio"
# Now your agent works in production!

# 4. Pull updates from cloud
zerodb sync pull
# Keep local and cloud in sync
```

---

